  <p id="c-nanqishu-031-xuanmiao-xunboyu:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-031-xuanmiao-xunboyu:p001:m0000" ref="5we_446_pbb_AA">荀伯玉</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-031-xuanmiao-xunboyu:p001:m0004" ref="5we_446_pbb_AA">弄璋</persName>，廣陵人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-031-xuanmiao-xunboyu:p001:m0013" ref="5we_446_pbb">永</persName>，南譙太守，父<persName id="c-nanqishu-031-xuanmiao-xunboyu:p001:m0021" ref="5we_446_pbb_A">闡之</persName>，給事中。</p>
